{ "Identifier":           {"ImplementerID": "1", "ImplementationID": "CAE-ASE-V1.0-I01", "AIMName": "1CAE-ASE-V1.0-I01"},
  "Header":               "CAE-ASE-V1.0",

  "APIProfile":           "Basic",
  "Description":          "Audio Scene Editing. Composes Basic Audio Scenes of Basic Audio Objects, and Audio Scenes of Objects and Scenes (CAE-ASM). One Scene is open at a time, so a User Command need not name it; opening is done by Port and creation opens implicitly. Objects arrive from CAE-AOE across the Topology. The User Point of View is set on the Scene; a member placed by its Space-Time may have its own. Every edit is a new version in Shared Storage. A translated Speech Object replaces the original in Shared Storage, under its identifier and with the Speech Qualifier the Translated Objects command states: every Scene holding it then holds the translation, at its place.",

  "InternalTypes":        [],

